{"id":"f71aeba7a1e4b877","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-ultrapower.md","title":"Ultrapower","display":"df-ultrapower — Ultrapower","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-ultrapower","aliases":["57-df-ultrapower"],"display":"df-ultrapower — Ultrapower","depends_on":["[[57-df-ultraproduct]]","[[57-df-structure]]","[[57-df-ultrafilter]]","[[57-df-indexed-product]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-ultrapower"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-ultrapower</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ultrapower — Ultrapower"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ba7cca711eed5e6b\" href=\"?note=ba7cca711eed5e6b\" title=\"57-df-ultraproduct\">57-df-ultraproduct</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7f0d0eb6e6bd2aa7\" href=\"?note=7f0d0eb6e6bd2aa7\" title=\"57-df-ultrafilter\">57-df-ultrafilter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"730f0de0d5c55c32\" href=\"?note=730f0de0d5c55c32\" title=\"57-df-indexed-product\">57-df-indexed-product</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\neq\\emptyset\">\\(I\\neq\\emptyset\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7f0d0eb6e6bd2aa7\" href=\"?note=7f0d0eb6e6bd2aa7\" title=\"57-df-ultrafilter\">57-df-ultrafilter</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\mapsto\\mathfrak A\">\\(i\\mapsto\\mathfrak A\\)</span> 为常值结构族，超积与等价类记号见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ba7cca711eed5e6b\" href=\"?note=ba7cca711eed5e6b\" title=\"57-df-ultraproduct\">57-df-ultraproduct</a>，积见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"730f0de0d5c55c32\" href=\"?note=730f0de0d5c55c32\" title=\"57-df-indexed-product\">57-df-indexed-product</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in A\">\\(a\\in A\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_a:I\\to A\">\\(c_a:I\\to A\\)</span> 是常值函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 是对角函数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A^I/\\mathcal U\\coloneqq\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathfrak A/\\mathcal U.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A^I/\\mathcal U\\coloneqq\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathfrak A/\\mathcal U.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"c_a\\coloneqq\\{\\langle i,a\\rangle:i\\in I\\},\\qquad\nd\\coloneqq\\{\\langle a,[c_a]_{\\mathcal U}\\rangle:a\\in A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[c_a\\coloneqq\\{\\langle i,a\\rangle:i\\in I\\},\\qquad\nd\\coloneqq\\{\\langle a,[c_a]_{\\mathcal U}\\rangle:a\\in A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"d:A\\to|\\mathfrak A^I/\\mathcal U|,\\qquad\n\\forall a,b\\in A\\;(d(a)=d(b)\\leftrightarrow a=b).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[d:A\\to|\\mathfrak A^I/\\mathcal U|,\\qquad\n\\forall a,b\\in A\\;(d(a)=d(b)\\leftrightarrow a=b).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>不再把等价关系当作超滤参数传给超积。对角映射是单射；由 Los 定理得到初等嵌入，但原结构一般不是字面上的子集，不能未经搬运直接称为包含它的初等扩张。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-ultraproduct","status":"resolved","id":"ba7cca711eed5e6b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-ultraproduct]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"7f0d0eb6e6bd2aa7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-indexed-product","status":"resolved","id":"730f0de0d5c55c32","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-indexed-product]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$，$I\\neq\\emptyset$，$\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)$，见 [[57-df-structure]]、[[57-df-ultrafilter]]。$i\\mapsto\\mathfrak A$ 为常值结构族，超积与等价类记号见 [[57-df-ultraproduct]]，积见 [[57-df-indexed-product]]。$a\\in A$；$c_a:I\\to A$ 是常值函数，$d$ 是对角函数。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"7f0d0eb6e6bd2aa7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$，$I\\neq\\emptyset$，$\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)$，见 [[57-df-structure]]、[[57-df-ultrafilter]]。$i\\mapsto\\mathfrak A$ 为常值结构族，超积与等价类记号见 [[57-df-ultraproduct]]，积见 [[57-df-indexed-product]]。$a\\in A$；$c_a:I\\to A$ 是常值函数，$d$ 是对角函数。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-ultraproduct","status":"resolved","id":"ba7cca711eed5e6b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$，$I\\neq\\emptyset$，$\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)$，见 [[57-df-structure]]、[[57-df-ultrafilter]]。$i\\mapsto\\mathfrak A$ 为常值结构族，超积与等价类记号见 [[57-df-ultraproduct]]，积见 [[57-df-indexed-product]]。$a\\in A$；$c_a:I\\to A$ 是常值函数，$d$ 是对角函数。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-indexed-product","status":"resolved","id":"730f0de0d5c55c32","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$，$I\\neq\\emptyset$，$\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)$，见 [[57-df-structure]]、[[57-df-ultrafilter]]。$i\\mapsto\\mathfrak A$ 为常值结构族，超积与等价类记号见 [[57-df-ultraproduct]]，积见 [[57-df-indexed-product]]。$a\\in A$；$c_a:I\\to A$ 是常值函数，$d$ 是对角函数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)","display":false},{"tex":"A=|\\mathfrak A|","display":false},{"tex":"I\\neq\\emptyset","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)","display":false},{"tex":"i\\mapsto\\mathfrak A","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"c_a:I\\to A","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A^I/\\mathcal U\\coloneqq\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathfrak A/\\mathcal U.","display":true},{"tex":"c_a\\coloneqq\\{\\langle i,a\\rangle:i\\in I\\},\\qquad\nd\\coloneqq\\{\\langle a,[c_a]_{\\mathcal U}\\rangle:a\\in A\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"d:A\\to|\\mathfrak A^I/\\mathcal U|,\\qquad\n\\forall a,b\\in A\\;(d(a)=d(b)\\leftrightarrow a=b).","display":true}],"bytes":1208,"backlinks":[{"id":"bbf3699dee0bf4ca","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S$，$\\equiv$ 为初等等价；$\\mathrm{UltraFilt}(I)$ 取 [[57-df-ultrafilter]]，超幂及同构取 [[57-df-ultrapower]]、[[57-df-isomorphism]]。量词 $I$ 遍历非空集合，背景集合论为 ZFC。"},{"id":"b3c8f915815b84c2","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S$，$I\\ne\\varnothing$，$\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)$。$d:|\\mathfrak A|\\to|\\mathfrak A^I/\\mathcal U|$ 是 [[57-df-ultrapower]] 正式定义的对角映射。$\\mathrm{ElemEmb}$ 及 $h:\\mathfrak A\\preceq\\mathfrak B$ 是下式的映射接口，不等同于字面子结构包含；定义中 $\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S$，$h$ 为候选函数。"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-207","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[57-df-S-ar]]\n[[57-df-SequentCalculus]]\n[[57-df-W-e]]\n[[57-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[57-df-acf]]\n[[57-df-arith0]]\n[[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arity]]\n[[57-df-assignment]]\n[[57-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[57-df-axiom-rule]]\n[[57-df-axiom-sequent]]\n[[57-df-back-and-forth]]\n[[57-df-beta-function]]\n[[57-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[57-df-bound-variable]]\n[[57-df-cardinal]]\n[[57-df-clause]]\n[[57-df-clause-set]]\n[[57-df-closed-world-assumption]]\n[[57-df-closure-operator]]\n[[57-df-cnf]]\n[[57-df-compactness-property]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-left]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-right]]\n[[57-df-consistency]]\n[[57-df-consistent]]\n[[57-df-constant]]\n[[57-df-contract-left]]\n[[57-df-contract-right]]\n[[57-df-creative]]\n[[57-df-cut-sequent]]\n[[57-df-decidable-theory]]\n[[57-df-definite-program]]\n[[57-df-derivable]]\n[[57-df-derivation]]\n[[57-df-disjunction-left]]\n[[57-df-disjunction-right]]\n[[57-df-dlo]]\n[[57-df-dnf]]\n[[57-df-domain]]\n[[57-df-dovf]]\n[[57-df-dovf-signature]]\n[[57-df-downward-LS-property]]\n[[57-df-dpll]]\n[[57-df-ef-game]]\n[[57-df-elementary-equivalence]]\n[[57-df-elementary-substructure]]\n[[57-df-emptyset]]\n[[57-df-endomorphism-algebra]]\n[[5